//! Embedded 8x8 monochrome bitmap font, ASCII 0x20..0x7E — a userspace
//! copy of the same glyph data used by the kernel's own framebuffer
//! driver (`huesos-fb`), so `Canvas::draw_text` can render locally into a
//! caller-owned VMO without any extra syscall. See `tools/fontgen/` in
//! the repo root for the generator. English/ASCII only, by design.

// Auto-generated 8x8 bitmap font, ASCII 0x20..0x7E, rendered from
